    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"disambig-see-also\"><i>See also:</i> <b class=\"Latn\"><a href=\"/wiki/v%C4%83n_h%C3%B3a\" title=\"văn hóa\">văn hóa</a></b>, <b class=\"Latn\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C4%83n_H%C3%B3a\" title=\"Văn Hóa\">Văn Hóa</a></b><span class=\"serial-comma\">,</span><span class=\"serial-and\"> <i>and</i></span> <b class=\"Latn\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C4%83n_Ho%C3%A1\" title=\"Văn Hoá\">Văn Hoá</a></b></div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Vietnamese\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vietnamese</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternative_forms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternative forms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Pronunciation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pronunciation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Noun\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Noun</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Usage_notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Quotations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quotations</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Alternative_forms\">Alternative forms</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=v%C4%83n-ho%C3%A1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"văn-hoá (page does not exist)\">văn-hoá</a></span>, <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/v%C4%83n_h%C3%B3a#Vietnamese\" title=\"văn hóa\">văn hóa</a></span>, <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=v%C4%83n-h%C3%B3a&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"văn-hóa (page does not exist)\">văn-hóa</a></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<ul class=\"etymid\" id=\"Vietnamese:&#95;文化\" data-lang=\"vi\" data-id=\"文化\"></ul><p><a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">Sino-Vietnamese</a>&#32;word from <i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96#Vietnamese\" title=\"文化\">文化</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><a href=\"/wiki/culture\" title=\"culture\">culture</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Japanese language\">Japanese</a></span> <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96#Japanese\" title=\"文化\">文化</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">bunka</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">culture</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_Chinese\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Middle Chinese\">Middle Chinese</a></span> <i class=\"Hant mention\" lang=\"ltc\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96#Middle_Chinese\" title=\"文化\">文化</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"ltc-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">mjun xwae<sup>H</sup></span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">the <a href=\"/wiki/way\" title=\"way\">way</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/educate\" title=\"educate\">educating</a> by using <a href=\"/wiki/morality\" title=\"morality\">morality</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/literature\" title=\"literature\">literature</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/music\" title=\"music\">music</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.\n</p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hanoi\">Hà Nội</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[van˧˧ hwaː˧˦]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu%E1%BA%BF\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Huế\">Huế</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[vaŋ˧˧ hwaː˨˩˦]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon\">Saigon</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[vaŋ˧˧ waː˦˥]</span> ~ <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[jaŋ˧˧ waː˦˥]</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun\">Noun</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/v%C4%83n#Vietnamese\" title=\"văn\">văn</a> <a href=\"/wiki/ho%C3%A1#Vietnamese\" title=\"hoá\">hoá</a></strong></span> (<i>classifier</i> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n%E1%BB%81n#Vietnamese\" title=\"nền\">nền</a></span>)&#32;\n</p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/culture\" title=\"culture\">culture</a>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"h-usage-example\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\">nền <b>văn hoá</b> tiên tiến, đậm đà bản sắc dân tộc</i> ― <span class=\"e-translation\">an advanced <b>culture</b> with a deep ethnic flavor</span></span></dd></dl></li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#colloquial\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">colloquial</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/primary_education\" title=\"primary education\">primary</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/secondary_education\" title=\"secondary education\">secondary education</a>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"h-usage-example collocation\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\">trình độ <b>văn hoá</b></i> ― <span class=\"e-translation\">number of (primary and secondary school) grades completed</span></span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"h-usage-example\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\">học <b>văn hoá</b></i> ― <span class=\"e-translation\">to study at primary or secondary school</span></span></dd></dl></li>\n<li><span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\">short for <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/tr%C3%ACnh_%C4%91%E1%BB%99#Vietnamese\" title=\"trình độ\">trình độ</a> <strong class=\"selflink\">văn hoá</strong></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">number of (primary and secondary school) grades completed</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></span></span>\n<ul><li><div class=\"citation-whole\"><span class=\"cited-source\"><span class=\"None\" lang=\"und\"><b>2001</b></span>, Chu Lai, chapter 9, in <cite>Cuộc đời dài lắm</cite>, NXB Văn học:</span><dl><dd><div class=\"h-quotation\"><span class=\"Latn e-quotation cited-passage\" lang=\"vi\">Hỏi gì trả lời nấy, cấm quanh co dài dòng. Nào, họ tên&#63; Quê quán&#63; Dân tộc&#63; <b>Văn hoá</b>&#63; Tham gia cách mạng năm nào&#63;</span><dl><dd><span class=\"e-translation\">You answer what we ask, no verbosity. So, full name? Place of origin? Ethnicity? <b>Level of schooling</b>? What year did you join the revolution?</span></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></div></li></ul></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Usage_notes\">Usage notes</h4></div>\n<p><i>Trình độ văn hoá</i> is often requested on forms. It can be answered \"X/12\" with \"X\" the number of grades completed, or \"X/10\" if one studied a trajectory counting only ten grades, etc.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Quotations\">Quotations</h4></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"see-cites\">For quotations using this term, see <a href=\"/wiki/Citations:v%C4%83n_ho%C3%A1#Vietnamese\" title=\"Citations:văn hoá\">Citations:<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\">văn hoá</span></a>.</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\"> ^ </a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"citation-whole\"><span class=\"cited-source\">Nguyễn Thụy Hân; Châu Thanh (<span class=\"None\" lang=\"und\">2022</span>), “Trình độ văn hóa là gì? Tốt nghiệp đại học thì ghi trình độ văn hóa thế nào?”, in <cite>Thư viện Pháp luật</cite>&#8206;<sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240412190152/https://thuvienphapluat.vn/chinh-sach-phap-luat-moi/vn/thoi-su-phap-luat/tu-van-phap-luat/42753/trinh-do-van-hoa-la-gi-tot-nghiep-dai-hoc-thi-ghi-trinh-do-van-hoa-the-nao\">[1]</a></sup>, archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://thuvienphapluat.vn/chinh-sach-phap-luat-moi/vn/thoi-su-phap-luat/tu-van-phap-luat/42753/trinh-do-van-hoa-la-gi-tot-nghiep-dai-hoc-thi-ghi-trinh-do-van-hoa-the-nao\">the original</a> on <span class=\"mw-formatted-date\" title=\"2024-04-12\">12 April 2024</span></span></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>",
    "wikitext": "{{also|văn hóa|Văn Hóa|Văn Hoá}}\n==Vietnamese==\n\n===Alternative forms===\n* {{alt|vi|văn-hoá|văn hóa|văn-hóa}}\n\n===Etymology===\n{{vi-etym-sino|文化|[[culture]]}}, from {{bor|vi|ja|文化||culture|tr=bunka}}, from {{der|vi|ltc|文化||the [[way]] of [[educate|educating]] by using [[morality]], [[literature]] and [[music]]}}.\n\n===Pronunciation===\n{{vi-IPA}}\n\n===Noun===\n{{vi-noun|cls=nền}}\n\n# [[culture]]\n#: {{uxi|vi|nền '''văn hoá''' tiên tiến, đậm đà bản sắc dân tộc|an advanced '''culture''' with a deep ethnic flavor}}\n# {{lb|vi|colloquial}} [[primary education|primary]] and [[secondary education]]\n#: {{coi|vi|trình độ '''văn hoá'''|number of (primary and secondary school) grades completed}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|học '''văn hoá'''|to study at primary or secondary school}}\n# {{short for|vi|[[trình độ]] [[văn hoá]]||number of (primary and secondary school) grades completed}}\n#* {{RQ:Chu Lai Cuoc doi dai lam|chapter=9|passage=Hỏi gì trả lời nấy, cấm quanh co dài dòng. Nào, họ tên? Quê quán? Dân tộc? '''Văn hoá'''? Tham gia cách mạng năm nào?|translation=You answer what we ask, no verbosity. So, full name? Place of origin? Ethnicity? '''Level of schooling'''? What year did you join the revolution?}}\n\n====Usage notes====\n''Trình độ văn hoá'' is often requested on forms. It can be answered \"X/12\" with \"X\" the number of grades completed, or \"X/10\" if one studied a trajectory counting only ten grades, etc.<ref>{{cite-web|author=Nguyễn Thụy Hân|author2=Châu Thanh|title=Trình độ văn hóa là gì? Tốt nghiệp đại học thì ghi trình độ văn hóa thế nào?|url=https://thuvienphapluat.vn/chinh-sach-phap-luat-moi/vn/thoi-su-phap-luat/tu-van-phap-luat/42753/trinh-do-van-hoa-la-gi-tot-nghiep-dai-hoc-thi-ghi-trinh-do-van-hoa-the-nao|year=2022|site=Thư viện Pháp luật|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20240412190152/https://thuvienphapluat.vn/chinh-sach-phap-luat-moi/vn/thoi-su-phap-luat/tu-van-phap-luat/42753/trinh-do-van-hoa-la-gi-tot-nghiep-dai-hoc-thi-ghi-trinh-do-van-hoa-the-nao|archivedate=12 April 2024}}</ref>\n\n====Quotations====\n* {{see citations|vi}}\n\n===References===\n{{reflist}}\n\n{{C|vi|Education|Sociology}}"
  }
